 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Nehemiah called the people to the gate",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 7.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Eliashib and priests began the work",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 7.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Sheep Gate doors were set in their place",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 7.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The wall rose up for every single soul",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 7.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Joy of the hand Gishalom repaired the Old Gate",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 7.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Beams were laid and bolts were made fast",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 6.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Next to them Melatiah of Gibeon stood",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 6.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And Jadon from Meronot helped them build",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 5.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Men of Gibeon and Mizpah joined the line",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 5.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Under the governor beyond the river",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 5.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Shoulders to the work, hands on the stone",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 4.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We raised the wall and closed the gap",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 4.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Sanballat and Tobiah were furious",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 4.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They conspired to fight against Jerusalem",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 4.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But we prayed to our God day and night",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 4.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And posted a guard against their threat",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 4.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Men of Gibeon and Mizpah joined the line",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 3.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Under the governor beyond the river",
